        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba wakhtiyadii oqoonla'aanta Ilaah baa dhaafay, laakiin hadda wuxuu dadka ku amrayaa in dhammaantood meel kastaba ha joogeene ay soo toobad keenaan; ",
          "type": "text",
